
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mie Jebew & Wonton Chili Oil</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; }
    h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#100b09] text-white">
  <nav class="bg-[#1c100d] border-b border-[#5b2b1c]">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-5 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-4">
      <a href="index.html" class="text-xl font-bold text-[#e8a34a]">Mie Jebew</a>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 text-sm">
        <a href="index.html" class="text-[#e8a34a]">Beranda</a>
        <a href="menu.html" class="hover:text-[#e8a34a]">Menu</a>
        <a href="tentang.html" class="hover:text-[#e8a34a]">Tentang</a>
        <a href="lokasi.html" class="hover:text-[#e8a34a]">Lokasi</a>
        <a href="pesan.html" class="hover:text-[#e8a34a]">Pesan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-[#e8a34a] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Pedasnya Bikin Nagih!</p>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6">Nikmat Pedas yang Bikin Ketagihan</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">Rasakan sensasi Mie Jebew dan Wonton Chili Oil dengan cita rasa gurih, pedas, dan nikmat di setiap gigitan.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="menu.html" class="bg-[#b83224] hover:bg-[#92251b] px-7 py-3 rounded-full font-bold">Lihat Menu</a>
          <a href="pesan.html" class="border border-[#e8a34a] text-[#e8a34a] hover:bg-[#e8a34a] hover:text-black px-7 py-3 rounded-full font-bold">Pesan Sekarang</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img src="img/banner.jpg" alt="Mie Jebew" class="w-full h-[420px] object-cover rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border border-[#70402a]">
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-[#1c100d] py-16">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-[#e8a34a] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-3">Kenapa Harus Kami?</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12">Rasa yang Bikin Ingin Lagi</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#291713]">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🌶️</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Level Pedas Pilihan</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400">Pilih tingkat kepedasan sesuai selera kamu.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#291713]">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🍜</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Rasa Menggugah Selera</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400">Perpaduan rasa gurih dan pedas yang nikmat.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#291713]">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-4">❤️</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Harga Bersahabat</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400">Menu lezat dengan harga terjangkau.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-5">Siap Menikmati Pedasnya?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-8">Pilih menu favoritmu dan pesan sekarang!</p>
      <a href="pesan.html" class="inline-block bg-[#b83224] hover:bg-[#92251b] px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold">Pesan Melalui WhatsApp</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="bg-[#1c100d] border-t border-[#5b2b1c] py-7 text-center text-gray-400 text-sm">
    © 2026 Mie Jebew & Wonton Chili Oil. Pedasnya Bikin Nagih!
  </footer>
